**Date:** {{ date }}
**Manufacturer:** {{ manufacturer_name }}
**Product:** {{ product_name }}
**Reference:** [SRP reference of the notification]

Field names follow ENISA's CRA SRP Glossary, version 1.6.

## Required for both

**Corrective or mitigating measures taken:** [Bulleted list or structured text]

**Corrective or mitigating measures that users can take:** [Action-oriented text]

## Required for an actively exploited vulnerability

**Date when corrective or mitigating measure has been available:** [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM]

**Details about the security update/corrective measure available:** [Fix version and how to get it]

**Description of the severity of the vulnerability:** [Detailed structured narrative]

**Description of the impact of the vulnerability:** [Detailed structured narrative]

**Malicious actor that has exploited/is exploiting the vulnerability:** [Required if known, at most 100 characters]

## Required for a severe incident

**Applied and ongoing mitigation measures:** [Structured narrative]

**Detailed description of the Severity of the incident:** [Structured narrative]

**Detailed description of the Impact of the incident:** [Structured narrative]

**Type of Threat or root cause that is likely to have triggered incident:** [Classification and short explanation]

## Contact Information

{% if security_contact_email %}
**Security Contact:** {{ security_contact_email }}
